{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        161.45289611816406,
        57.98431396484375,
        292.0669250488281,
        84.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "1. Introduction",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.1357879638672,
        399.1128234863281,
        203.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Every year some 8 million children in developing countries die before they reach their",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.1357879638672,
        399.1528625488281,
        216.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "fifth birthday; many during the first year of life. Eight in ten of these deaths are due",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.1357879638672,
        399.08294677734375,
        229.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "to neonatal conditions, acute respiratory infections (mostly pneumonia), diarrhoea",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.1357879638672,
        399.0729675292969,
        242.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "(including dysentery), malaria, or severe malnutrition – or a combination of these",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.0057830810547,
        399.1280517578125,
        255.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Pocket Book of Hospital Care for Children conditions. The   was first published in 2005,",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.1357879638672,
        399.0229187011719,
        268.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "as a compilation of guidelines for the management of these common childhood",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.1357727050781,
        399.0727844238281,
        281.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "illnesses at the first-referral level in low-resource settings with limited equipment and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.1357727050781,
        399.1728820800781,
        294.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "staff capacity. It is part of a series of documents and tools that support the Integrated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.1357727050781,
        399.0829162597656,
        307.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Management of Childhood Illness (IMCI) guidelines for outpatient management of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.1357727050781,
        399.0528259277344,
        320.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "sick children. The Pocket Book guidelines focus on the inpatient management of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.1357727050781,
        399.06298828125,
        333.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "major causes of childhood mortality, such as pneumonia, diarrhoea, malaria, severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.1357727050781,
        399.08294677734375,
        346.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "acute malnutrition (SAM), HIV/AIDS, and common or life-threatening causes of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.1357727050781,
        275.452880859375,
        359.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "fever (i.e. meningitis, otitis media, and typhoid fever).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        359.1357727050781,
        399.1413879394531,
        372.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Since the first edition was published in 2005, new evidence has emerged resulting",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.1357727050781,
        399.1227722167969,
        385.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "in updates of several WHO guidelines. These include: prevention and antiretroviral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.1357727050781,
        399.11285400390625,
        398.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "treatment in children with HIV; feeding of HIV-exposed children; treatment of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.1357727050781,
        399.1028747558594,
        411.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis (TB), malaria, and convulsions in children; management of chronic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.1357727050781,
        399.122802734375,
        424.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "pain; and an update of the essential medicine list for children. These updates, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.0058288574219,
        399.1371154785156,
        437.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "Pocket  others, have meant that there was a need to update the relevant sections of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.0058288574219,
        79.17240142822266,
        450.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "Book .",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        450.13580322265625,
        396.8504943847656,
        463.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "To ensure that most recommendations were up to date, the Pocket Book was re­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        463.13580322265625,
        399.10284423828125,
        476.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "viewed by the Guidelines Steering Committee (GSC), which identified and prioritized",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        169.36129760742188,
        475.91583251953125,
        203.79132080078125,
        489.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        476.13580322265625,
        399.0435485839844,
        489.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "chapters requiring updates ( ). These constituted the basis of the collation and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        489.13580322265625,
        399.0228576660156,
        502.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "synthesis of the evidence for the recommendations on the management of common",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        502.13580322265625,
        399.04296875,
        515.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "childhood conditions and illnesses. These recommendations specifically focussed on",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        515.1358032226562,
        399.1129455566406,
        528.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "management of newborn conditions, treatment of cough and difficult in breathing,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        528.1358032226562,
        396.8504943847656,
        541.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "treatment of dysentery, management and treatment of common causes of fever, anti­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        541.1358032226562,
        399.06292724609375,
        554.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "biotics in management of severe malnutrition, sublingual sugar for management of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.1358032226562,
        399.0627746582031,
        567.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "hypoglycaemia, detection of hypoxaemia and use of oxygen therapy, and choice of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        567.1358032226562,
        200.51295471191406,
        580.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "fluids in the management of shock.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        580.1358032226562,
        399.0316467285156,
        593.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "This document provides the background, methods, and analysis of the evidence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        593.1358032226562,
        399.0829162597656,
        606.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "used in making all the recommendations put forth during the Guidelines Development",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        606.1358032226562,
        399.1327819824219,
        619.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "Group (GDG) meeting convened in February 2011 at WHO headquarters in Geneva,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.52369689941406,
        644.9403076171875,
        229.5196990966797,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "3",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
